    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a JSON API.\nRespond only with valid JSON.\nDo not include any explanations, markdown, or code fences.\n\nUse the following user preferences:\n\nCooking time: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cookingTime.join(\", \") }}\nCuisine: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cuisine[0]}}\n\nDiet: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].diet[0]}}\n\nPortions: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].portions}}\n\nPersons: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].persons}}\n\nCreate 3 different recipes using the following ingredients (use them in \"myIngredients\"):\n{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.ingredients\n  .map(i => `${i.amount} ${i.selectedUnit} ${i.ingredient}`)\n  .join(\"\\n\")}}\n\nGenerate a random id-number with 6 random numbers in \"id\" \n\nReturn the entire result as one valid JSON array with exactly 3 recipe objects.\nThe JSON array must start with [ and end with ].\n\nEach recipe object must have exactly the following properties:\n\n\"title\": string\n\n\"nutritionalInformations\": array of 4 strings\n\n\"Energy: 1900 kcal\"\n\n\"Protein: 65 g\"\n\n\"Fat: 25 g\"\n\n\"Carbs: 380 g\"\n\n\"myIngredients\": array of strings\n\n\"extraIngredients\": array of max 3 simple ingredient strings\n\n\"steps\": array of max 5 short strings (cooking steps)\n\n\"cookingtime\": string like \"20mins\"\n\n\"cuisine\": one string that contains only:\n\nthe cuisine from {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cuisine[0]}}\n\n\"diet\": one string that contains only:\n\nthe diet from {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].diet[0]}}\n\n\"persons\": number (use {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].persons}})\n\n\"likes\": number, always 0\n\n\"id\": number\n\nExample of the structure only (do not copy values, just follow the shape):\n\n[\n{\n\"title\": \"string\",\n\"nutritionalInformations\": [\"string\", \"string\", \"string\", \"string\"],\n\"myIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"extraIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"steps\": [\"string\"],\n\"cookingtime\": \"string\",\n\"cuisine\": \"string\",\n\"diet\": \"string\",\n\"persons\": 2,\n\"likes\": 0,\n\"id\": 0\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"string\",\n\"nutritionalInformations\": [\"string\", \"string\", \"string\", \"string\"],\n\"myIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"extraIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"steps\": [\"string\"],\n\"cookingtime\": \"string\",\n\"cuisine\": \"string\",\n\"diet\": \"string\",\n\"persons\": 2,\n\"likes\": 0,\n\"id\": 0\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"string\",\n\"nutritionalInformations\": [\"string\", \"string\", \"string\", \"string\"],\n\"myIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"extraIngredients\": [\"string\"],\n\"steps\": [\"string\"],\n\"cookingtime\": \"string\",\n\"cuisine\": \"string\",\n\"diet\": \"string\",\n\"persons\": 2,\n\"likes\": 0,\n\"id\": 0\n}\n]\n\nAgain: respond with only the JSON array, nothing else.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
